  ],
  "notes": "Label = nRF pin name (P0.02...) where printed (rule 5 GPIO name); XIAO board name D0..D10 first in functions. Image 2 Arduino-number boxes (\"7 / 6\" = Mbed / Non-Mbed core numbering per the image note) kept as printed. Image 2 internal signals (RESET/P0.18 button, RGB/charge LEDs, PWR/PDM microphone, I2C1 IMU) are not edge pads and were skipped. Image 1 battery-management text list is not a pin map."
